AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Settings  profile default
 1 Recognize     │ 
 2 Listen        │ › token                        0123…cdef  (audd config set token)
 3 Now playing   │     API token, kept in the system credential store
 4 Streams       │   format                       auto  (default)
 5 History       │     default output format: table, json, jsonl, csv (auto: table on a terminal, JSON when piped)
 6 Account       │   max_requests                 no limit  (default)
*7 Settings      │     default --max-requests for every command
 8 Help          │   concurrency                  4  (default)
                 │     parallel requests for batch recognition
                 │   streams.background_recorder  true  (default)
                 │     start the background stream recorder automatically
                 │ 
                 │ Settings apply to profile default and are saved in config-dir/config.toml. Environment variables
                 │ (env) win over the file.
